25:T524,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I buy a SIM card at Jeddah Airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"stc, Mobily, and Zain booths are located in the arrivals hall right after baggage claim in Terminal 1. Zain counters near the exit gates are open 24/7 for late-night flights."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a tourist SIM cost in Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A tourist data SIM costs between SAR 60 and SAR 150 depending on the bundle, ranging from 10GB up to unlimited monthly data. Pilgrim 'Hajj & Umrah' bundles are also available."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need my passport to buy a SIM in Saudi Arabia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. SIM registration is mandatory in Saudi Arabia, so bring your passport — the counter staff will also take a fingerprint scan as part of registration, which is a legal requirement for every active SIM. The whole process takes 2–3 minutes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use an eSIM instead of a physical SIM?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. You can activate an stc or Zain eSIM through their app before you land, so you have data the moment you arrive — useful for contacting your pre-booked driver."}}]}1a:["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#FAFAF7] text-[#1C1C1C] pb-24","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"SIM Card Guide at Jeddah Airport\",\"description\":\"Exactly where to buy local 5G eSIMs from stc, Mobily, or Zain at Terminal 1 and the North Terminal upon landing.\",\"url\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/guides/jeddah-airport-sim-card\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://taxisaudiarabia.com/guides/jeddah-airport-sim-card\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Taxi Saudi Arabia\",\"ur